                <p class="section-subtitle">
                    Start your borrowing journey by following these
                    simple steps.
                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="row g-4">

                <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">

                    <div class="step-card">

                        <div class="step-number">1</div>

                        <h5>Create an Account</h5>

                        <p>
                            Register using your personal details
                            to access your borrower account.
                        </p>

                    </div>

                </div>

                <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">

                    <div class="step-card">

                        <div class="step-number">2</div>

                        <h5>Complete Your Profile</h5>

                        <p>
                            Provide the information required to
                            establish your borrower profile.
                        </p>

                    </div>

                </div>

                <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">

                    <div class="step-card">

                        <div class="step-number">3</div>

                        <h5>Upload Documents</h5>

                        <p>
                            Submit the identification and supporting
                            documents required for verification.
                        </p>

                    </div>

                </div>

                <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">

                    <div class="step-card">

                        <div class="step-number">4</div>

                        <h5>Apply for a Loan</h5>

                        <p>
                            Choose an available loan product, submit
                            your application and follow its progress.
                        </p>

                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>

            <div class="text-center mt-4">

                <a asp-area="Identity"
