                    </p>

                    <div class="trust-item">
                        <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i>
                        <span>
                            Convenient access to your borrower account.
                        </span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="trust-item">
                        <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i>
                        <span>
                            Organised submission of supporting documents.
                        </span>
